<title>USA: Alleghany Corp Q1 EPS $1.77 vs $2.28.</title>
<headline>Alleghany Corp Q1 EPS $1.77 vs $2.28.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						   March 31</p>
<p>						1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenues				  $504.7	 $468.1</p>
<p> Earnings before taxes		   18.4	   24.7</p>
<p> Net earnings				12.9	   16.8</p>
<p> Net earnings per share of	     1.77	   2.28</p>
<p>common stock  Average number of outstanding  7,283,242    7,361,428</p>
<p>NOTES: All figures in millions, except share and per share figures.</p>
<p>Shares of common stock adjusted to reflect dividends of common stock declared inMarch of 1996 and 1997.</p>
<p>The Q1 1996 net includes a $4.2 million pre-tax charge for the write-down of title plants and goodwill, and an $8 million pre-tax gain from the reduction of title claims reserves.</p>
</text>
